title: Reshuffle the Leadership
subtitle: Change the balance on the Central Committee.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: shuffle_leadership_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; shuffle_leadership_timer = 6

The Central Committee decides the party's line between congresses, and its balance of currents decides the line. Whom will you promote?

- @defencist: The Revolutionary Defencists.
- @intl: The Internationalists.
- @unions: The trade unionists.
- @bund: The Bund.
- @easy_discard

@defencist
on-arrival: {!
RO.fac(Q, 'defencist', 6, -5);
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', -2, 4);
RO.fac(Q, 'rightdef', -1, 2);
RO.fac(Q, 'unions', -1, 1);
RO.fac(Q, 'bund', -1, 1);
!}

Dan and Tsereteli have a firmer hold on the committee.

@intl
on-arrival: {!
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', 6, -5);
RO.fac(Q, 'defencist', -3, 4);
RO.fac(Q, 'rightdef', -1, 4);
RO.fac(Q, 'unions', -1, 0);
RO.fac(Q, 'bund', -1, 0);
!}

Martov and Sukhanov have more votes on the committee.

@unions
on-arrival: {!
RO.fac(Q, 'unions', 5, -5);
RO.fac(Q, 'defencist', -2, 2);
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', -2, 2);
RO.fac(Q, 'bund', -1, 0);
!}

Gvozdev and the union men have a larger say.

@bund
on-arrival: {!
RO.fac(Q, 'bund', 5, -5);
RO.fac(Q, 'defencist', -2, 1);
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', -2, 1);
RO.fac(Q, 'unions', -1, 0);
!}

Liber and Abramovich have a larger say in the committee, which is a fair reward for being the party's most reliable bloc.
